{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42319","headline":"玉笥山留题 · 徐铉","name":"玉笥山留题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙乡会应远，王事知何极。\n征传莫辞劳，玉峰聊一息。\n形骸已销散，心想都凝寂。\n真气自清虚，非关好松石。\n九仙皆积学，洞壑多遗迹。\n游子归去来，胡爲但征役。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}